1
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,040
What are the problems in college?

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,060
Both sides.

3
00:00:07,060 --> 00:00:09,620
What are the problems and how people like it?

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,200
Mainly both sides.

5
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,520
Some people want their dogs to leave campus,

6
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,400
some want their dogs to stay at campus

7
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,240
and they care for them better

8
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,940
because they don't keep them there.

9
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,600
So we are finding out about this from other people.

10
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,080
When boys come to our night camp

11
00:00:25,080 --> 00:00:29,780
while coming, dogs run after them

12
00:00:29,780 --> 00:00:31,820
so children also face problems

13
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:40,980
They run a lot.

14
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,400
And the dogs that live near their rooms,

15
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:48,640
they put biscuits in them.

16
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:51,160
They don't say much to them.

17
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,740
So I also don't like dogs myself.

18
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,880
If they get angry here and the kids are troubled

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,320
then even I can chase away them.

20
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,860
And the problem is that it's all right

21
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,480
some children like it but some don't.

22
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,420
So we have this problem.

23
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:09,500
If we remove it from here, then it will be much better.

24
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:16,000
Because around 6 months ago a child jumped down from the balcony

25
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:19,000
and both his legs were fractured.

26
00:01:20,060 --> 00:01:21,380
That was also a big factor.

27
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:25,260
The child was on the first floor.

28
00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:27,040
What would have happened if there had been second floor?

29
00:01:28,340 --> 00:01:30,160
So this is dangerous for children.

30
00:01:34,180 --> 00:01:37,520
I have seen many people giving food to dogs.

31
00:01:37,840 --> 00:01:41,560
They give food, biscuits and eggs.

32
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:47,660
Some kids like it and some don't.

33
00:01:47,980 --> 00:01:50,240
Do you have any personal experience?

34
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,740
You can get food from the canteen or from the kitchen.

35
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:57,120
I don't have any problem with that.

36
00:01:57,580 --> 00:02:00,600
If they come here, I will make them run away.

37
00:02:46,700 --> 00:02:48,000
From the whole campus?

38
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:49,680
Yes, from the whole campus.

39
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:56,180
Some kids have problems with their life.

40
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:57,140
They don't like it at all.

41
00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,860
It is a very problematic thing for them.

42
00:03:00,660 --> 00:03:03,420
And some people like it and some don't like it too.

43
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:08,440
But those who don't like it, they might have more problems.

44
00:03:09,620 --> 00:03:10,180
Problems?

45
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:11,220
Yes, there are problems.

46
00:03:17,700 --> 00:03:19,220
It should be in Bhawan.

47
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,920
If we cross the road somewhere,

48
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:23,960
if I go out of Jhahar,

49
00:03:24,580 --> 00:03:25,940
then I will be sitting near Srojini's gate

50
00:03:25,940 --> 00:03:27,420
and all dogs come

51
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:29,340
and they run behind my bike

52
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:31,840
so I have to stop

53
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:35,440
If I give a race to the car

54
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,920
then they will also run

55
00:03:42,940 --> 00:03:44,860
Thank you brother

